    "zh-CN": "*SC - SISTAR COMPANY | One Spark, Infinite Galaxifying：依托 Qubit Algorithm™、*SC intelligence-core、Scarlet AI、Qubit Biz 与 Biz Galaxy 商业矩阵强劲驱动。官方企业门户：https://sistarcompany.com &bull; 决策层直联联系人：DennyKu (denniiku@sistarcompany.com)",
